    <div style="text-align:left; margin-bottom:8px;border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; border-style:none none none none;"><font style="font-size:10pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',Times,serif;"><b>ADDITIONAL TERMS OF THE NOTES</b></font>
