    <div style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:8px;border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; border-style:none none none none;"><font style="font-size:10pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',Times,serif;">The Final Valuation Date and the Maturity Date are subject to postponement in certain circumstances, as described under &#147;Reference Assets&#8212;Indices&#8212;Market Disruption Events for Securities with an Index of Equity Securities as a Reference Asset&#148; and &#147;Terms of the Notes&#8212;Payment Dates&#148; in the accompanying prospectus supplement.</font>
    </div>

    <div style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:8px;border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; border-style:none none none none;"><font style="font-size:10pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',Times,serif;">In addition, the Reference Asset and the Notes are subject to adjustment by the Calculation Agent under certain circumstances, as described under &#147;Reference Assets&#8212;Indices&#8212;Adjustments Relating to Securities with an Index as a Reference Asset&#148; in the accompanying prospectus supplement.</font>
    </div>



    <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:2px;border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; border-style:none none none none;"><font style="font-size:10pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',Times,serif;">PS&#151;7</font>
    </div>

