    </div>

   </td>

   <td style="padding-top:1px;">
    <div style ="padding-left:4px;margin-top:4px;margin-bottom:4px; text-align:justify;"><font style="font-size:10pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',Times,serif;">a variety of economic, financial, political, regulatory or judicial events;</font>
    </div>

   </td>

