    </div>

    <div style="text-align:left;padding-left:12px; margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:16px;border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; border-style:none none none none;"><font style="font-size:10pt;font-family:'Times New Romans',Times,serif;">(market cap neutral) - default</font>
    </div>

   </td>

   <td  colspan="1"  width="10%"  rowspan="1"  valign="center"  style = "padding-left:5.4px ;padding-right:5.4px ; " >
    <div style="text-align:center;text-indent:24px;padding-left:48px; margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:16px;border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; border-style:none none none none;"><font style="font-size:10pt;font-family:'Times New Romans',Times,serif;">&nbsp;</font>
    </div>

   </td>

   <td  colspan="1"  width="24%"  rowspan="1"  valign="top"  style = "padding-left:5.4px ;padding-right:5.4px ; " >
    <div style="text-align:left;padding-left:16px; margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:16px;border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; border-style:none none none none;"><font style="font-size:10pt;font-family:'Times New Romans',Times,serif;">If the rights are in the money, the spot price of the underlying security will be adjusted after market close of the day prior to the ex-date and the index shares of the underlying security will adjust to offset the price adjustment thus making the event a market cap neutral event.</font>
    </div>

   </td>

   <td  colspan="1"  width="10%"  rowspan="1"  valign="top"  style = "padding-left:5.4px ;padding-right:5.4px ; " >
    <div style="text-align:center;text-indent:24px;padding-left:48px; margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:16px;border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; border-style:none none none none;"><font style="font-size:10pt;font-family:'Times New Romans',Times,serif;">&nbsp;</font>
    </div>

   </td>

   <td  colspan="1"  width="27%"  rowspan="1"  valign="top"  style = "padding-left:5.4px ;padding-right:5.4px ; " >
    <div style="text-align:center; margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:16px;border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; border-style:none none none none;"><font style="font-size:10pt;font-family:'Times New Romans',Times,serif;">No</font>
    </div>

