    </div>

    <div style="text-align:center; margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:16px;border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; border-style:none none none none;"><font style="font-size:10pt;font-family:'Times New Romans',Times,serif;">&nbsp;</font>
    </div>

    <div style="text-align:center; margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:16px;border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; border-style:none none none none;"><font style="font-size:10pt;font-family:'Times New Romans',Times,serif;">&nbsp;</font>
    </div>

   </td>

  </tr>

  <tr>

   <td  colspan="1"  width="15%"  rowspan="1"  valign="top"  style = "padding-left:5.4px ;padding-right:5.4px ; " >
    <div style="text-align:left;padding-left:12px; margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:16px;border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; border-style:none none none none;"><font style="font-size:10pt;font-family:'Times New Romans',Times,serif;">Special cash dividend (standard treatment)</font>
    </div>

